		{"id":"8c751b7e538f61e6","type":"text","text":"| ID  | Prompt                                                                                                      | Expected intent                        | Sources                                      | Pass if                                                                                        | Scenario                                    | Link with chat id                                               |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | Based on current execution, should DigiDevalaya stay on the current plan or reset the milestone? Recommend. | `decision_risk`                        | Knowledge + workgraph                        | Recommendation + confidence; cites sources or admits gaps                                      | Recommendation                              |                                                                 |\n| 2   | Are there risks that look GREEN in trackers but RED in execution?                                           | `product_status` or `decision_risk`    | Both knowledge + workgraph                   | Explicit tracker vs task conflict; no false “all healthy” if overdue/blocked exists            | Risks                                       |                                                                 |\n| 3   | What risk should we accept vs mitigate on AI Kruise?                                                        | decision_risk                          | Knowledge                                    | Distinguishes accept vs mitigate; recommendation stated                                        | Risks                                       |                                                                 |\n| 4   | If Inspecto slips two weeks, what is the organizational impact?                                             | decision_risk                          | Knowledge + workgraph                        | Impact framed beyond the product (deps, customers, leadership attention); assumptions explicit | Impacts                                     | http://localhost:5173/chat/0a07521e-9c19-4c30-9728-f25c2eaff7a8 |\n| 5   | Give me AI Kruise status as of the latest tracker week.                                                     | product_status                         | Both                                         | Time-aware if data exists; says what’s missing if not                                          | Status                                      |                                                                 |\n| 6   | <br>Quick RAG status across all products.                                                                   | `product_status` / `general`           | <br>Knowledge (+ workgraph)                  | Per-product signal; does not invent GREEN; notes empty products                                | Status                                      |                                                                 |\n| 7   | Tell me about DigiDevalaya as a product — current focus and state.                                          | `product_status` / `general`           | Knowledge (+ workgraph)                      | Product-grounded summary; not generic marketing fluff                                          | Product information                         |                                                                 |\n| 8   | Who are the product owners? Who owns what?                                                                  | people_ownership                       | Workgraph (`search_work_users`, mapped_only) | Full mapped list without asking “which product?”; cites names + product_key                    | PO/people                                   |                                                                 |\n| 9   | Search knowledge for “release readiness” across products.                                                   | document_hunt                          | Knowledge (+ OneDrive if needed)             | Search-shaped answer; cites docs/snippets                                                      | source knowledge                            |                                                                 |\n| 10  | Release impact for Inspecto: narrative vs tasks.                                                            | <br>`product_status` / `decision_risk` | Both                                         | Impact + dual grounding; recommendation if asked implicitly by “impact”                        | Combination: source knowledge + task module | http://localhost:5173/chat/9aed0bb4-b9fe-4748-a5da-1d77e4656d29 |\n| 11  | Any leadership correspondence this week that should change priorities?                                      | `enterprise_context` / `decision_risk` | EK (+ knowledge)                             | CoS judgment, not email dump                                                                   | Enterprise context                          | http://localhost:5173/chat/d8b438d7-a6a6-4175-b5f0-3755aa70967f |","x":-461,"y":-236,"width":1581,"height":896},
		{"id":"12dbb6bf96ee009f","type":"text","text":"| Category            | Entity                                  | Example User Input                                  | Auto Apply?                                | Approval Needed?     |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **WorkQueueItem**                       | \"Task 'Build login flow' is now 90% complete.\"      | ✅ Yes (existing task status/progress only) | ❌ No                 |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **MetricItem**                          | \"Current MRR is now $42k.\"                          | ✅ Yes                                      | ❌ No                 |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **StakeholderItem**                     | \"Quick note: Sarah seemed happy with progress.\"     | ✅ Yes (minor notes only)                   | ❌ No                 |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **RiskItem**                            | \"Found a new risk: Vendor API will be deprecated.\"  | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes (Always)       |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **OpportunityItem**                     | \"Customer would pay extra for SSO.\"                 | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes (Always)       |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **DecisionItem**                        | \"We chose PostgreSQL.\"                              | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes (Always)       |\n| **HQ Intelligence** | **ArtifactItem**                        | \"Added architecture document v2.\"                   | ❓ Not defined                              | ❓ Depends (Untested) |\n| **Register**        | **MasterWorkQueueRegister**             | \"Move this completed work into the register.\"       | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **Register**        | **RiskRegister**                        | \"Escalate this risk into the Risk Register.\"        | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **Register**        | **OpportunityRegister**                 | \"Promote this opportunity into the register.\"       | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **Register**        | **StrategicPrioritiesRegister**         | \"This is now a company strategic priority.\"         | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **The Books**       | **ExecutiveDecisionsRegister**          | \"Company-wide decision: standardize on PostgreSQL.\" | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **The Books**       | **OrganizationalMemoryRegister**        | \"Lesson learned from last month's outage.\"          | ❌ No                                       | ✅ Yes                |\n| **The Books**       | **StakeholderItem (Relationship Book)** | \"Talked with Sarah today.\"                          | ✅ Yes (minor notes only)                   | ❌ No                 |","x":1280,"y":-236,"width":1075,"height":800},
