			"id":"f00b8274e56ddeaa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## General initiation\n\n\n### System capability\n1. How can you help me?\n### general conversation staters\n1. start with hi or hello\n\n## Demo prompts\n\n### status across all \n1. Quick RAG status across all products.\n### specific product status \n1. Release impact for AI Kruise narrative vs tasks\n### groundedness check\n1. Are there risks that look GREEN in trackers but RED in execution?\n### risk, gap and impact analyser\n1. Management has three possible initiatives:\n    1. Expanding on computer vision capabilities and processing features on stock. \n    2. Expand AI Kruise nationally\n    We have enough capacity to execute only one over the next 3 months. Give me the risk gap and impact analysis.\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":1120,
			"width":1100,
			"height":820
		},
		{
			"id":"0c02652e1b403e91",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### context: \n\nWe have loaded 3 products \n1. AI Kruise\n2. ERP\n3. Stock\n\nAll have daily tracker and weekly reports of june and july. \n### persona \n\n* PMO\n\n### credentials \n\nemail - aishwarya.salimath@keehoo.ai\npassword - 123456",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":800,
			"y":1280,
			"width":660,
			"height":500
		},
		{
			"id":"4075829915b2fd0c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**1. Best cross-product test**\n\n> **“I want to introduce a new initiative that integrates Kruise Workflow with the IIP/ERP system. Based on the work happening since August 10, what risks, gaps, dependencies, and delivery conflicts would this new initiative introduce?”**\n\n**2. New work inside Kruise**\n\n> **“I want to introduce a new requirement in Kruise Workflow: workflows should support reliable scheduled execution in production. Given the work already happening, what new risks and gaps would this introduce, and what existing work does it depend on?”**\n\n**3. New work inside IIP**\n\n> **“I want to introduce a new ERP requirement for an end-to-end automated Stock receiving workflow. Looking at the current IIP work, what existing work would this depend on, and what new risks or gaps would it create?”**\n\n**4. New priority competing with existing work**\n\n> **“If I make a new Kruise Workflow–ERP integration a top priority, what existing work in IIP and Kruise could be affected, and what risks or bottlenecks should I expect?”**\n\n**5. CEO decision question**\n\n> **“I am considering approving a new cross-product initiative between IIP/ERP and Kruise Workflow. Before I approve it, tell me what existing work it would depend on, what risks and gaps it introduces, and whether there is anything already in progress that could make this a bad time to start.”**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-240,
			"y":-1040,
			"width":1040,
			"height":580
		}
